    </p><a href="/">← Home</a><pagefind-searchbox></pagefind-searchbox><script type="module" src="/pagefind/pagefind-component-ui.js"></script><script type="text/javascript" src="/static/pagefind.js"></script><h1 class="instruction-section" data-pagefind-body="1" data-pagefind-weight="10" data-pagefind-sort="title">ABS</h1><p class="insn_subtitle" data-pagefind-body="1">Absolute value</p>
      <p class="aml" data-pagefind-body="1">This instruction calculates the absolute value of the signed integer value
in the source register, and writes the result to the destination register.
If the value in the source register is the most negative value, the result
is the same as the value in the source register.</p>
    
    <h3 class="classheading"><a id="iclass_integer"></a>Integer class
